{"id":"2e059389c097fae1","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md","title":"ZFC Normal Measure","display":"df-zfc-normal-measure — ZFC Normal Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-normal-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-normal-measure","58-df-zfc-large-normal-measure","58-df-zfc-largecard2-normal-measure","58-df-zfc-largecard3-normal-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-normal-measure — ZFC Normal Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measurable-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-normal-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-normal-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-large-normal-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-largecard2-normal-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-largecard3-normal-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-normal-measure — ZFC Normal Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4cf9725e6800030d\" href=\"?note=4cf9725e6800030d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-measurable-ultrafilter.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-measurable-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeNormalMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargeNormalMeasure}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2NormalMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2NormalMeasure}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3NormalMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3NormalMeasure}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurableUltrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurableUltrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\)</span> (measurable-ultrafilter predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\\)</span> (function predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasurableUltrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land\\forall S\\in U\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in S\\mid f(\\alpha)=\\beta\\}\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasurableUltrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land\\forall S\\in U\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in S\\mid f(\\alpha)=\\beta\\}\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias\\text{-}large} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargeNormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias\\text{-}large} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargeNormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias\\text{-}largecard2} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias\\text{-}largecard2} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias\\text{-}largecard3} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3NormalMeasure}_S(\\kappa,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias\\text{-}largecard3} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3NormalMeasure}_S(\\kappa,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Normality is expressed by the regressive-function/Fodor property on every measure-one set. The base predicate already supplies nonprincipality and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-large-normal-measure</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-largecard2-normal-measure</code>, and <code>58-df-zfc-largecard3-normal-measure</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-measurable-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"4cf9725e6800030d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measurable-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeNormalMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2NormalMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3NormalMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasurableUltrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasurableUltrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land\\forall S\\in U\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)<\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta<\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in S\\mid f(\\alpha)=\\beta\\}\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias\\text{-}large} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargeNormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias\\text{-}largecard2} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}alias\\text{-}largecard3} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3NormalMeasure}_S(\\kappa,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":2199,"backlinks":[{"id":"37a3e43a3599a849","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0d480b0822a231c2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U,\\kappa\\in V$，$\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)$ 使用 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md]]。"},{"id":"d73e3b0726a3b895","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"62fc4eb5c29a689d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a6ccd6f7d977ed72","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)$ (normal measure predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-normal-measure]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2839","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md|58-df-zfc-normal-measure]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["4cf9725e6800030d","36d7463d215be751"]}